# Battle system

Read `src/battle/README.md` before changing the engine or battle data; it covers the battle model, the event system, and listener conventions.

Pokestar battles differ from the main-series games: all six Pokémon are on the field in a grid, turn order comes from Combat Readiness, moves are Basic, Power, or Ultimate tier with cooldowns, there are no critical hits, and missed moves still deal damage but usually skip secondary effects.

To add a move, ability, effect, or held item, follow the matching skill: `add-move`, `add-ability`, `add-effect`, or `add-held-item`.
